# The live node configuration never belongs here. This repository is public;
# govexy-node.conf carries the estate's addresses (Redis, load balancer) and
# per-node identity. The tracked file is govexy-node.conf.example — copy it to
# govexy-node.conf on the node and edit the copy. Secrets live in the
# application's .env, which is not managed from here.
*.conf
!*.conf.example
*.local
*.local.conf
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.log
